Then add it to your MCP client configuration:

**Warning:** Base64 encoding is not encryption. The value in your configuration file is effectively a plaintext password. Do not commit this file to version control or share it.

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "dhi": {
      "url": "https://dhi.io/mcp",
      "headers": {
